BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3480271142613735878@strava.com
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260506T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260506T193000
DTSTAMP:20260503T124425Z
SUMMARY:Fun on the Common
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Martin Thomas\n\nThis will be the same as last week. \n
 I have added this to repeat each Wednesday. The structure may change over t
 he weeks however the principle will remain the same … structured effort a
 nd recovery. \n\nEfforts session suitable for all abilities. \n\nWarm up fo
 llowed by a series of low hill repeats. \nCool down stretches. \nRoughly 40
  mins of efforts with breaks. \nTotal session is an hour.\n\nThe base sessi
 on will be three sets of three loops with rest between each set. \nStronger
  runners can opt to add an extra full or half loop. Equally those new to ef
 forts or coming back from injury can reduce the number. \n\nAs ever\, effor
 t is up the hill then stretch out and recover on the flats and downs. \n\nT
 he session has a single location so you’ll never be far from the rest of 
 the group.\n\nIt’s on well trodden paths although I’d still recommend t
 rail shoes (particularly if it has rained)\n\nDo bring water. \n\nCome and 
 have fun 🤩\n\nMartin\n[Phone Number Redacted]\n\n\nView on Strava: https
 ://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3480271142613735878\n\nSynced f
 rom Strava Club 208705 on Sun\, 3 May @ 1:44 PM
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Leader: Martin ThomasThis will be the same as 
 last week. I have added this to repeat each Wednesday. The structure may ch
 ange over the weeks however the principle will remain the same … structur
 ed effort and recovery. Efforts session suitable for all abilities. Warm up
  followed by a series of low hill repeats. Cool down stretches. Roughly 40 
 mins of efforts with breaks. Total session is an hour.The base session will
  be three sets of three loops with rest between each set. Stronger runners 
 can opt to add an extra full or half loop. Equally those new to efforts or 
 coming back from injury can reduce the number. As ever\, effort is up the h
 ill then stretch out and recover on the flats and downs. The session has a 
 single location so you’ll never be far from the rest of the group.It’s 
 on well trodden paths although I’d still recommend trail shoes (particula
 rly if it has rained)Do bring water. Come and have fun 🤩Martin[Phone Num
 ber Redacted]View on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_even
 ts/3480271142613735878Synced from Strava Club 208705 on: Sun\, 3 May @ 1:44
  PM
LOCATION:Churchdown Road Malvern England WR14 United Kingdom
URL:https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3480271142613735878
CATEGORIES:Running,Club Event
